Globalization on witos (plan step R1.2b, RFC 0015 section 8): the sysroot carries ICU's headers alone, so the
configure looks for no ICU library; the shim loads ICU at run time, reports its absence, and .NET runs in invariant
mode until ICU joins the system layer.
On release/8.0 (plan step N3.2) the change is the same.

--- a/src/native/libs/System.Globalization.Native/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/native/libs/System.Globalization.Native/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -33,6 +33,8 @@
         if(CLR_CMAKE_TARGET_OSX)
             add_definitions(-DOSX_ICU_LIBRARY_PATH="/usr/lib/libicucore.dylib")
             add_definitions(-DU_DISABLE_RENAMING)
+        elseif(CLR_CMAKE_TARGET_WITOS)
+            # WitOS's sysroot has ICU's headers alone: the shim loads ICU at run time and reports its absence.
         else()
             find_library(ICUUC icuuc)
             if(ICUUC STREQUAL ICUUC-NOTFOUND)
